    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Duration and limits",
     "texto": [
      "**Od… do…** means «from… until…» and usually takes the genitive: **od rana do wieczora**. **Przez** shows duration.",
      "**Podczas** and **w ciągu** also express a time frame and are followed by the genitive: **podczas spotkania**, **w ciągu dnia**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
